{
  "info": {
    "name": "Mesa de Incidentes - API base y Fase 2",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Infraestructura suministrada y solicitudes de las dos ampliaciones pendientes. base_url es el origen, sin /api/v1. Los logins sustituyen token. Credenciales ficticias exclusivas de evaluación."
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "incidente_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "responsable_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "API base suministrada",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login editor",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/login",
            "description": "",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"editor@mesa.test\",\n  \"password\": \"Evaluacion2026!\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", pm.response.json().token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login lector",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/login",
            "description": "",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"lector@mesa.test\",\n  \"password\": \"Evaluacion2026!\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", pm.response.json().token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Listado paginado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/incidentes?page=1",
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Detalle",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/incidentes/{{incidente_id}}",
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear incidente",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/incidentes",
            "description": "Requiere editor. Devuelve 201 y guarda incidente_id. Con lector debe responder 403.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"titulo\": \"Incidente ficticio desde HTTP\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Descripción suficiente para la evaluación de la API base.\",\n  \"estado\": \"abierto\",\n  \"responsable_id\": {{responsable_id}}\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"incidente_id\", pm.response.json().data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar campos base",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/incidentes/{{incidente_id}}",
            "description": "Requiere editor. Conserva los atributos no enviados. Con lector debe responder 403.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"estado\": \"en_proceso\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout del token actual",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/logout",
            "description": ""
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", \"\");",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Ampliaciones pendientes del aspirante",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Pendiente 1 - Filtro por prioridad",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/incidentes?prioridad=alta&page=1",
            "description": "Ejercicio del aspirante: en la base suministrada este parámetro aún no filtra. Tras implementarlo debe devolver solo prioridad alta con paginación; valores inválidos deben responder 422."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Pendiente 2 - Actualizar solo prioridad",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/incidentes/{{incidente_id}}/prioridad",
            "description": "Ejercicio del aspirante: esta ruta no está registrada inicialmente. Tras implementarla: editor 200, lector 403, sin token 401, prioridad inválida 422 y recurso inexistente 404.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"prioridad\": \"alta\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
